                "title": "Sleek Brass Leverset with Round Rose",
                "description": "The Sleek Solid Brass Lever with Round Rose made by Omnia features a circular rose paired with a sleek lever. It has concealed screw mounting for an ultra modern appearance. Easy to install, the Omnia 171 Lever will cover 2-1/8 inch bore door holes. The Sleek Brass Leverset with Round Rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. \r\n",
